msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Beispiel::"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:29
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Klassen"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:33
msgid ""
"Construct an ``LSM9DS1`` instance, verify the WHO_AM_I registers of both "
"sub-devices, configure all three sensors and enable the accel/gyro FIFO in "
"continuous mode."
msgstr ""
"Erstellt eine ``LSM9DS1``-Instanz, überprüft die WHO_AM_I-Register beider "
"Teilgeräte, konfiguriert alle drei Sensoren und aktiviert die Accel/Gyro-"
"FIFO im kontinuierlichen Modus."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:37
msgid "``bus``"
msgstr "``bus``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:38
msgid "A configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` bus the sensor is attached to."
msgstr ""
"Ein konfigurierter :py:class:`machine.I2C`-Bus, an den der Sensor "
"angeschlossen ist."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:40
msgid "``address_imu``"
msgstr "``address_imu``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:41
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the accelerometer/gyroscope sub-device. Defaults to "
"``0x6B``."
msgstr ""
"7-Bit-I2C-Adresse des Beschleunigungssensor-/Gyroskop-Teilgeräts. "
"Standardmäßig ``0x6B``."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:44
msgid "``address_magnet``"
msgstr "``address_magnet``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:45
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the magnetometer sub-device. Defaults to ``0x1E``."
msgstr ""
"7-Bit-I2C-Adresse des Magnetometer-Teilgeräts. Standardmäßig ``0x1E``."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:48
msgid "``gyro_odr``"
msgstr "``gyro_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:49
msgid ""
"Gyroscope output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0`` (off), ``14.9``, "
"``59.5``, ``119``, ``238``, ``476`` or ``952``."
msgstr ""
"Ausgabedatenrate des Gyroskops in Hz. Muss einer der Werte ``0`` (aus), "
"``14.9``, ``59.5``, ``119``, ``238``, ``476`` oder ``952`` sein."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:52
msgid "``gyro_scale``"
msgstr "``gyro_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:53
msgid ""
"Gyroscope full-scale range in degrees-per-second. Must be one of ``245``, "
"``500`` or ``2000``."
msgstr ""
"Vollausschlagsbereich des Gyroskops in Grad pro Sekunde. Muss einer der "
"Werte ``245``, ``500`` oder ``2000`` sein."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:56
msgid "``accel_odr``"
msgstr "``accel_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:57
msgid ""
"Accelerometer output data rate in Hz. Same set of values as ``gyro_odr``."
msgstr ""
"Ausgabedatenrate des Beschleunigungssensors in Hz. Gleiche Wertemenge wie "
"``gyro_odr``."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:60
msgid "``accel_scale``"
msgstr "``accel_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:61
msgid ""
"Accelerometer full-scale range in g. Must be one of ``2``, ``4``, ``8`` or "
"``16``."
msgstr ""
"Vollausschlagsbereich des Beschleunigungssensors in g. Muss einer der Werte "
"``2``, ``4``, ``8`` oder ``16`` sein."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:64
msgid "``magnet_odr``"
msgstr "``magnet_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:65
msgid ""
"Magnetometer output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0.625``, ``1.25``, "
"``2.5``, ``5``, ``10``, ``20``, ``40`` or ``80``."
msgstr ""
"Ausgabedatenrate des Magnetometers in Hz. Muss einer der Werte ``0.625``, "
"``1.25``, ``2.5``, ``5``, ``10``, ``20``, ``40`` oder ``80`` sein."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:68
msgid "``magnet_scale``"
msgstr "``magnet_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:69
msgid ""
"Magnetometer full-scale range in gauss. Must be one of ``4``, ``8``, ``12`` "
"or ``16``."
msgstr ""
"Vollausschlagsbereich des Magnetometers in Gauss. Muss einer der Werte "
"``4``, ``8``, ``12`` oder ``16`` sein."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:74
msgid ""
"Write a hard-iron offset vector into the magnetometer's ``OFFSET_REG_*_M`` "
"registers. The offset is given in the same units as :meth:`magnet` returns "
"(gauss); each component is converted to raw LSBs using the configured "
"magnetometer scale before being written."
msgstr ""
"Schreibt einen Hard-Iron-Offset-Vektor in die ``OFFSET_REG_*_M``-Register "
"des Magnetometers. Der Offset wird in denselben Einheiten angegeben, die "
":meth:`magnet` zurückgibt (Gauss); jede Komponente wird unter Verwendung der"
" konfigurierten Magnetometer-Skala in rohe LSBs umgerechnet, bevor sie "
"geschrieben wird."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:82
msgid ""
"Return the single-byte ``WHO_AM_I`` register value of the "
"accelerometer/gyroscope sub-device."
msgstr ""
"Gibt den Ein-Byte-Wert des ``WHO_AM_I``-Registers des "
"Beschleunigungssensor-/Gyroskop-Teilgeräts zurück."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:87
msgid ""
"Return the single-byte ``WHO_AM_I`` register value of the magnetometer sub-"
"device."
msgstr ""
"Gibt den Ein-Byte-Wert des ``WHO_AM_I``-Registers des Magnetometer-"
"Teilgeräts zurück."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:92
msgid "Return the gyroscope vector ``(x, y, z)`` in degrees per second."
msgstr "Gibt den Gyroskop-Vektor ``(x, y, z)`` in Grad pro Sekunde zurück."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:96
msgid ""
"Return the acceleration vector ``(x, y, z)`` in units of standard gravity (1"
" g = 9.81 m/s²)."
msgstr ""
"Gibt den Beschleunigungsvektor ``(x, y, z)`` in Einheiten der Standard-"
"Erdbeschleunigung (1 g = 9,81 m/s²) zurück."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:101
msgid "Return the magnetic-field vector ``(x, y, z)`` in gauss."
msgstr "Gibt den Magnetfeldvektor ``(x, y, z)`` in Gauss zurück."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:105
msgid ""
"Generator that yields ``(gyro, accel)`` tuples for every sample currently "
"available in the FIFO and stops once the FIFO is empty. Each component "
"vector has the same units as :meth:`gyro` and :meth:`accel` respectively."
msgstr ""
"Generator, der ``(gyro, accel)``-Tupel für jede aktuell in der FIFO "
"verfügbare Probe liefert und anhält, sobald die FIFO leer ist. Jeder "
"Komponentenvektor hat dieselben Einheiten wie :meth:`gyro` bzw. "
":meth:`accel`."
